\par (1a) - }{\fs26\insrsid2563700 Ban \'aei\'d2u ph\'e8i d\'f9 \'b8n t\'d8nh, TP m\'eb t\'b5i kho\'b6n v\'b5 l\'cay x\'b8c nh\'cbn kh\'e8i l\'ad\'eeng th\'f9c hi\'d6n khi thanh to\'b8n kh\'e8i l\'ad\'eeng x\'a9y l\'bep v\'b5 mua s\'bem thi\'d5t b\'de trong n
\'ad\'edc.
\par 
\par (1b) - Ban \'aei\'d2u ph\'e8i d\'f9 \'b8n t\'d8nh, TP m\'eb t\'b5i kho\'b6n t\'b9i Ng\'a9n h\'b5ng N\'abng \tab nghi\'d6p.
\par 
\par (2) - G\'f6i nhu c\'c7u v\'e8n v\'b5 x\'b8c nh\'cbn kh\'e8i l\'ad\'eeng th\'f9c hi\'d6n.
\par 
\par (3) - G\'f6i h\'e5 s\'ac r\'f3t v\'e8n thanh to\'b8n.
\par 
\par (4) - Th\'abng b\'b8o thanh to\'b8n cho d\'f9 \'b8n \'ae\'d5n Ng\'a9n h\'b5ng N\'abng nghi\'d6p \tab Vi\'d6t nam.
\par 
\par (5)  Th\'f9c hi\'d6n thanh to\'b8n.
\par 
\par }{\insrsid2563700 
\par }}}{\shprslt{\*\do\dobxcolumn\dobypara\dodhgt8212\dptxbx\dptxlrtb{\dptxbxtext\pard\plain \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\widctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f36\fs24\cf2\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid2563700 
